{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/26069ea16cc9a3de25908dae0aa3e403.poster.avif?t=1767955250\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/26069ea16cc9a3de25908dae0aa3e403.webm?t=1767955250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/26069ea16cc9a3de25908dae0aa3e403.mp4?t=1767955250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NEW! Ascension Mode</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, Intense, and Competitive. Discover pure combat runs! You start with a generous inventory featuring guaranteed rare tiles. Shortened animations, tight timings, intense music. No dilemmas, no detours - dive into rhythmic battles with enticing rewards. Climb the global leaderboard, challenge your friends, face escalating difficulty and aim for the perfect score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are not the hero. You are the monster.</strong> Unbound Eternity is a deck-builder with turn-based combat where you invade the lands of the &quot;Eye&quot; cult. Master your characters and their rune combos, craft your deck, and forge your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode: Unlock &amp; Conquer</strong> Discover characters, powers, and secrets. Navigate between battles, merchants, and twisted dilemmas. Collect permanent buffs and artifacts to challenge the cult's hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runes Are Your Engine</strong> Spend runes to play cards. Chain tiles, poison enemies, sacrifice health for devastating attacks. Each monster has multiple runes per turn - use them for brutal combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Created by an Indie Duo</strong> Solid mechanics, replayability, and dark humor. 2 to 8+ hours per Story run - or endless hours in Ascension. All the cards are in your hand. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, are you ready?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Cycle 1 - Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3274090/a1f303a53052a91f28387380637728e0c85ccab9.jpg"},{"name":"Cycle 2 - Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3274090/a8088c5ab4db10e95032e0f55942843c4f755536.jpg"},{"name":"Cycle 3 - Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3274090/3dcbe30d221459b47a007f92914ef1175276e393.jpg"},{"name":"Scrooge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3274090/cf4946c9347f1503f35b3de464129361fdf146a6.jpg"},{"name":"Demon Beast - Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3274090/0d54b9a4648f6e38c9a12a04571830a42f9152d2.jpg"},{"name":"Demon Beast - Novice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3274090/a41580432d94abbac96fd4ea9cf0845be3da90c4.jpg"},{"name":"Eldrich Terror - Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3274090/b247731377a9e07bf6166d0bdf37760bcf54c830.jpg"},{"name":"Eldrich Terror - Novice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3274090/d2013520774b7aad44e5861affe401e92e0ccb4d.jpg"},{"name":"Slime King - Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3274090/2bbcb484029b0c4473b151a74f87f6377fee79b0.jpg"},{"name":"Slime King - Novice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3274090/91b1ddf8acb03d1c9b1eae8c10d828aa94967349.jpg"}],"total":30},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3274090?t=1767955250","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/bac8fc9dbf91768749ccaf78495e18f95feb6013/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767955250","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/3605ebff107eca607c22f761fda31f51c4dc7f15/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767955250","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/3605ebff107eca607c22f761fda31f51c4dc7f15/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767955250","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/26069ea16cc9a3de25908dae0aa3e403.poster.avif?t=1767955250\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/26069ea16cc9a3de25908dae0aa3e403.webm?t=1767955250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/26069ea16cc9a3de25908dae0aa3e403.mp4?t=1767955250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NEW! Ascension Mode</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, Intense, and Competitive. Discover pure combat runs! You start with a generous inventory featuring guaranteed rare tiles. Shortened animations, tight timings, intense music. No dilemmas, no detours - dive into rhythmic battles with enticing rewards. Climb the global leaderboard, challenge your friends, face escalating difficulty and aim for the perfect score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are not the hero. You are the monster.</strong> Unbound Eternity is a deck-builder with turn-based combat where you invade the lands of the &quot;Eye&quot; cult. Master your characters and their rune combos, craft your deck, and forge your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode: Unlock &amp; Conquer</strong> Discover characters, powers, and secrets. Navigate between battles, merchants, and twisted dilemmas. Collect permanent buffs and artifacts to challenge the cult's hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runes Are Your Engine</strong> Spend runes to play cards. Chain tiles, poison enemies, sacrifice health for devastating attacks. Each monster has multiple runes per turn - use them for brutal combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Created by an Indie Duo</strong> Solid mechanics, replayability, and dark humor. 2 to 8+ hours per Story run - or endless hours in Ascension. All the cards are in your hand. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, are you ready?</p>","developers":["Yunicorn Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/f1c30691df2d542458deb2136664a89d4a5e7915/header.jpg?t=1767955250","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.14<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li